The component has TWO output ports and must write to both:
  - Port 1 must receive one PieceProgress record for EVERY input piece, carrying the running position of that piece within its firing and the cumulative glaze volume applied so far (including that piece).
  - Port 0 must receive one FiringSummary record per firing, emitted after every piece in the firing has been consumed.

