tests.user_message:
Fix the following CTL2 Reformat transform so that it compiles and does what the specification says. List every problem you fix with the reason, then give the complete corrected code.

Specification (one output record per input order line):
1. order_id: copied unchanged.
2. customer_name: the input name with surrounding whitespace trimmed. When the input name is null, empty or whitespace-only, output "UNKNOWN".
3. A record with a null qty is dropped and sent to no output.
4. line_total: qty x unit_price, reduced by discount_pct percent, rounded half-up to 2 decimal places. discount_pct is a whole-number percentage from 0 to 100, and null means no discount. Example: qty 3, unit_price 20.00, discount_pct 10 gives 54.00.
5. order_date: parsed from order_date_text, which is written as day.month.year with a two-digit day, a two-digit month and a four-digit year (15.03.2026 is 15 March 2026). When order_date_text is null or cannot be parsed, order_date is null and the record is still sent.
6. is_domestic: true exactly when country_code is "CZ" or "SK", otherwise false. country_code is always an uppercase two-letter ISO code.
7. order_month: the calendar month of order_date, 1 = January through 12 = December. Null when order_date is null.
8. The transform must stay in compiled mode. Keep the //#CTL2:COMPILE header.

Port 0 (in):
<Metadata id="M0"><Record name="OrderLine" type="delimited"><Field name="order_id" type="long" nullable="false"/><Field name="customer_name" type="string" nullable="true"/><Field name="qty" type="integer" nullable="true"/><Field name="unit_price" type="decimal" length="12" scale="2" nullable="false"/><Field name="discount_pct" type="integer" nullable="true"/><Field name="order_date_text" type="string" nullable="true"/><Field name="country_code" type="string" nullable="false"/></Record></Metadata>

Port 0 (out):
<Metadata id="M1"><Record name="PricedLine" type="delimited"><Field name="order_id" type="long" nullable="false"/><Field name="customer_name" type="string" nullable="false"/><Field name="line_total" type="decimal" length="12" scale="2" nullable="false"/><Field name="order_date" type="date" nullable="true"/><Field name="is_domestic" type="boolean" nullable="false"/><Field name="order_month" type="integer" nullable="true"/></Record></Metadata>

```ctl
//#CTL2:COMPILE
function integer transform() {
    $out.0.order_id = $in.0.order_id;
    $out.0.customer_name = if(isBlank($in.0.customer_name), "UNKNOWN", trim($in.0.customer_name));
    if ($in.0.qty == null) {
        return SKIP;
    }
    integer disc = nvl($in.0.discount_pct, 0);
    $out.0.line_total = round($in.0.qty * $in.0.unit_price * ((100 - disc) / 100), 2);
    date d = str2date($in.0.order_date_text, "dd.mm.yyyy") : null;
    $out.0.order_date = d;
    $out.0.is_domestic = $in.0.country_code ~= "CZ|SK";
    $out.0.order_month = getMonth(d) - 1;
    return ALL;
}
```

