Fix the following CTL2 Rollup transform so that it compiles and does what the specification says. List every problem you fix with the reason, then give the complete corrected code.

The Rollup groups its input by warehouse_id (the input is sorted by warehouse_id). The group accumulator record is StockAcc, given below.

Specification (exactly one output record per warehouse):
1. warehouse_id: the warehouse of the group.
2. line_count: the number of stock lines of the warehouse.
3. total_qty: the sum of qty over all the warehouse's lines. qty is never null.
4. avg_qty_per_line: total_qty / line_count as a whole number, truncated toward zero. Integer division is intended here.
