Fix the following CTL2 transform of an ExtHashJoin so that it compiles and does what the specification says. List every problem you fix with the reason, then give the complete corrected code.

The join is a LEFT OUTER join on customer_id. Port 0 is the master (orders), port 1 the slave (customers); every order is output once, whether or not a customer matched.

Specification:
1. order_id and customer_id: copied from the order.
2. customer_tier: the customer's tier. "UNMATCHED" when no customer matched.
3. The discount rate is 10% for tier "GOLD", 5% for "SILVER", and 0 for any other tier and for unmatched orders. Tier values are always uppercase.
4. net_amount: amount reduced by the discount rate, rounded half-up to 2 decimal places.
5. email_domain: the part of the customer's email after the "@", in lower case ("jan.novak@Example.COM" gives "example.com"). A non-null email always contains exactly one "@". Null when the email is null or no customer matched.
6. over_limit: true when net_amount is greater than the customer's credit_limit. A null credit_limit means no limit, so over_limit is false; it is also false when no customer matched.

Input port 0:
<Metadata id="M0"><Record name="Order" type="delimited"><Field name="order_id" type="long" nullable="false"/><Field name="customer_id" type="long" nullable="false"/><Field name="amount" type="decimal" length="12" scale="2" nullable="false"/></Record></Metadata>

Input port 1:
<Metadata id="M1"><Record name="Customer" type="delimited"><Field name="customer_id" type="long" nullable="false"/><Field name="tier" type="string" nullable="false"/><Field name="email" type="string" nullable="true"/><Field name="credit_limit" type="decimal" length="12" scale="2" nullable="true"/></Record></Metadata>

Output port 0:
<Metadata id="M2"><Record name="PricedOrder" type="delimited"><Field name="order_id" type="long" nullable="false"/><Field name="customer_id" type="long" nullable="false"/><Field name="customer_tier" type="string" nullable="false"/><Field name="net_amount" type="decimal" length="12" scale="2" nullable="false"/><Field name="email_domain" type="string" nullable="true"/><Field name="over_limit" type="boolean" nullable="false"/></Record></Metadata>

```ctl
